# Cezar 12 — Cursor Rules

## Monorepo
- pnpm workspaces: `packages/web`, `packages/api`, `packages/worker`, `packages/shared`
- Turbo orchestrates builds: run `pnpm dev` from root, not from individual packages
- Cross-package imports use workspace aliases: `@cezar12/shared`, `@cezar12/api`, etc.
- Schema changes go in `packages/shared/src/db/schema.ts` — never duplicate

## TypeScript
- Strict mode is on in `packages/api`, `packages/worker`, `packages/shared`
- `packages/web` uses relaxed settings for legacy compatibility; new files should still be strict
- Prefer `type` over `interface` for pure type aliases
- Use `satisfies` operator instead of `as` casts where possible

## Backend (packages/api)
- Fastify v5 — always `await` plugin registration
- Route files export `FastifyPluginAsync` — never use callbacks
- Input validation with Zod (via `fastify-type-provider-zod` or manual schema)
- All routes require auth unless explicitly marked public with `{ public: true }`
- Return consistent shapes: `{ data: T }` on success, `{ error: string, code?: string }` on failure

## Worker (packages/worker)
- BullMQ workers run with `concurrency` set per queue (see `src/queues.ts`)
- Always acquire `aiSemaphore` before calling any AI API
- On failure after 3 retries, update `ai_jobs.status = "failed"`
- Geometric backoff: `[1_000, 4_000, 16_000]` ms

## Database
- Drizzle ORM only — never write raw SQL unless absolutely necessary
- Prefer `.select().from().where()` over `db.query.*` for explicit column selection
- All mutations should be in transactions where atomicity matters
- Never expose `password_hash` in API responses — always exclude it

## Frontend (packages/web)
- No `<form>` elements — all wizard/form state is pure React state
- All AI output is rendered client-side via `AIServiceCard` (5 states)
- Financial engine (`lib/financial-engine.ts`) runs synchronously client-side
- RTL support: use `dir="rtl"` on Arabic text, use `start`/`end` for logical margins

## Design System
- Use CSS variable tokens (`hsl(var(--primary))`) not raw hex values
- Use `cn()` from `@/lib/utils` for all className merging
- Never use Tailwind `#` color values — only predefined palette tokens
- oxblood / cream / ember / ink are the 4 brand colors

## Security
- Never log tokens, API keys, or JWT contents
- File uploads must be validated via `validateUpload()` in `packages/api`
- Rate limiting is applied at the Fastify plugin level — don't re-implement
- Admin routes must always go through `adminGuard` plugin

## Arabic / i18n
- Arabic text always uses `dir="rtl"` and `font-mono-ed` for numeric values
- Disclaimer injection is mandatory for all AI output — never skip
- Arabic text goes second (after English) in bilingual components

## Testing
- Unit tests in `__tests__/` or `src/test/` using Vitest
- Mock the DB with a typed mock object — never use a real test DB
- Security middleware tests should always use `// @vitest-environment node` workaround if needed
- Aim for tests on all public API methods of service classes
